            "note": {
              "2015": [
                "2015\r\n  Statistics relating to 2015 show differences in number of persons in localities compared to other tables of population within and outside of localities in 2015. This is due to different methods for people who do not have information about address/cadastral parcel in the population register. In 2015, they were registered at the center coordinate for the parish. Statistics referring to years after 2015 use the center coordinate for the largest locality per municipality.  "
              ]
